# UMML Asynchronous Music Sequencer (Without Assertions for Demo)
# A clockless drum machine combining all 4 Uncontestable Features.

# FEATURE 4: Deterministic Initialization (The Spine)
spine the clock to step_kick for init
spine the clock to step_snare for init

# MEMORY: Store the beat pattern states
make a memory named step_kick with size 16
make a memory named step_snare with size 16

# COMPUTE: The drum sound triggers
make a neuron named kick_drum with threshold 1 and leak 0
make a neuron named snare_drum with threshold 1 and leak 0

# FEATURE 2: Metamorphic Spatial Obfuscation
make a metamorphic router named secure_bus_kick
morph the spike from step_kick through secure_bus_kick to kick_drum with key 8'hF0

make a metamorphic router named secure_bus_snare
morph the spike from step_snare through secure_bus_snare to snare_drum with key 8'hA5

# TEMPO: An async pulse generator to drive the rhythm
make a neuron named tempo_master with threshold 1 and leak 0
flow the spike from tempo_master into the read of step_kick
flow the spike from tempo_master into the read of step_snare

start the system
